---
// OfertaAlpha.astro — Grand Slam Offer Turma Alpha (Hormozi $100M Value Stack)
// Padrão Impeccable (Craft Floor) — Estilo Obsidian, SVG Icons e Zero Emojis
---

<section id="oferta" class="relative py-28 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-slate-950 text-white overflow-hidden border-t border-slate-900">
  <!-- Iluminação Focal Dourada Sutil -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[700px] h-[350px] bg-amber-500/5 blur-[150px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    <!-- Header da Seção -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-950/40 text-amber-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2" />
        </svg>
        <span>Turma Piloto Alpha • 10 Vagas Exclusivas</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-4">
        A Oferta da Turma Alpha • <span class="text-amber-400">LEXI Alpha</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Tudo o que você precisa para eliminar o bloqueio de tradução e destravar sua fala real, na plataforma própria da LEXI Alpha e acompanhado pessoalmente por Gabriel Lima (Gabe).
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Card Principal Obsidian da Grand Slam Offer -->
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-amber-500/30 bg-slate-900/90 p-6 sm:p-12 shadow-2xl relative ring-1 ring-amber-500/20">
      <!-- Selo de Vagas -->
      <div class="absolute -top-3.5 right-6 sm:right-10 px-4 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-400 text-amber-950 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide shadow-md">
        Apenas 10 Vagas
      </div>

      <!-- A Pilha de Valor (The Value Stack) -->
      <div class="mb-10">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>O que está incluso na Turma Alpha:</span>
        </h3>

        <div class="space-y-3.5">
          <!-- Item 1 -->
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-800">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-3 h-3 stroke-current fill-none stroke-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm sm:text-base">Acesso de Fundador à LEXI Alpha (LMS Próprio & 5 Portais)</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">Ambiente interativo moderno sem burocracias, com os 2.500 chunks nucleares mapeados na Montanha B2.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 line-through shrink-0 ml-4">R$ 1.500</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Item 2 -->
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-800">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-3 h-3 stroke-current fill-none stroke-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm sm:text-base">Treinador de Reflexo Oral FSRS-6 & Construtor de Chunks</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">Algoritmo de repetição espaçada que monitora sua automaticidade e destrava respostas em &lt; 4 segundos.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 line-through shrink-0 ml-4">R$ 800</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Item 3 -->
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-800">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-3 h-3 stroke-current fill-none stroke-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm sm:text-base">Motor Nativo de Gamificação LEXI Alpha (100% Focado na Fluência)</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">5 Corações diários, sequências com reparo automático de streaks e Coroas Douradas sem anúncios nem perda de foco.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 line-through shrink-0 ml-4">R$ 500</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Item 4 -->
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-800">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-3 h-3 stroke-current fill-none stroke-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm sm:text-base">Salas de Imersão com os 7 Guardiões da IA (Recasting Natural)</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">Jordan, Miles, Zack, Alexandra, Hayes e tutoria AIDA reformulando seus erros organicamente sem caneta vermelha.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 line-through shrink-0 ml-4">R$ 900</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Item 5 (Bônus 1) -->
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-950/20 border border-amber-500/20">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-amber-950 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/40 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold text-[10px]">
                ★
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="inline-block text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-amber-400 tracking-wider mb-0.5">Bônus Exclusivo Alpha</div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm sm:text-base">Diagnóstico Individual de Destrave Oral por Gabriel Lima (Gabe)</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">Análise personalizada do seu ponto cego de fala com plano de ataque direto para a B2.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-amber-400/80 line-through shrink-0 ml-4">R$ 1.500</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Item 6 (Bônus 2 - Complementar) -->
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-950/20 border border-amber-500/20">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-amber-950 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/40 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold text-[10px]">
                ★
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="inline-block text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-amber-400 tracking-wider mb-0.5">Bônus Complementar Extra</div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm sm:text-base">Companion de Bolso 24/7 (Chat Móvel Extra)</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">Acesso complementar para bater papo informal livre por texto e voz no celular quando e onde quiser.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-amber-400/80 line-through shrink-0 ml-4">R$ 500</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Resumo de Preço e Ancoragem -->
      <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-800 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 mb-8">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Valor Total Somado:</span>
          <span class="text-xl text-slate-500 font-bold line-through">R$ 5.700,00</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-emerald-400 mt-1 font-semibold">Economia de R$ 5.203 na Turma Alpha</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center md:text-right">
          <span class="text-xs text-amber-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Condição Especial Turma Piloto:</span>
          <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">
            12x de <span class="text-amber-400">R$ 49,70</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">ou R$ 497 à vista no PIX</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Botão de Ação Direta -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/5511967239791?text=Gabe,%20quero%20garantir%20uma%20das%2010%20vagas%20da%20Turma%20Alpha%20na%20LEXI%20Alpha"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-3 py-4 sm:py-5 px-6 rounded-xl font-extrabold text-base sm:text-lg bg-amber-400 hover:bg-amber-300 text-amber-950 transition-all shadow-xl shadow-amber-500/20 active:scale-98"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12.04 2c-5.46 0-9.91 4.45-9.91 9.91 0 1.75.46 3.45 1.32 4.95L2.05 22l5.25-1.38c1.45.79 3.08 1.21 4.74 1.21 5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91 0-2.65-1.03-5.14-2.9-7.01A9.816 9.816 0 0 0 12.04 2z" />
          </svg>
          <span>QUERO GARANTIR MINHA VAGA NA TURMA ALPHA</span>
        </a>

        <!-- Garantia Blindada Dupla -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-400 pt-2 text-center">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 stroke-current fill-none stroke-2 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" />
          </svg>
          <span><strong>Garantia Incondicional de 30 Dias:</strong> Se você não sentir a evolução no reflexo oral, devolvemos 100% do seu valor.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
